== Best combination ==

=== Best charactor to combo with Moco ===

=== Moco X Homer ===
When Homer drone detects an enemy and explodes, Moco Mark will activate immediately. This can be used to locate enemy positions, initiate combat, plan stealth attacks, or simply find enemies for your team.

=== Moco X Maro ===
This is a suitable combo for a sniper, using Moco to boost Maro damage and maximize its effectiveness.

=== Moco X Clu ===
Use Clu to scan for enemies on the minimap, then follow with Moco mark to make their locations clearer.

=== Moco X Shiro ===
Moco is still necessary to initiate the fight, but when under pressure and unable to retaliate, she lets Shiro take over the information-gathering role from Moco in that situation.

=== Moco X Otho ===
Use Moco to save time in pinpointing enemy locations, and to save time when pinpointing multiple enemies simultaneously using Otho.

=== Moco X Koda and Iris ===
Since Koda and Iris doesn't share information with teammates, use Moco to share information with the team.

=== Moco X Alvaro ===
Use Moco information to pinpoint their location, then use Alvaro-enhanced bombs to ambush and kill the enemies.

