Use fire wall of Ignis to block enemies eyes and use Moco to mark enemies on backfront of fire wall to kill enemies by enemies can't strike back Ignis can counter Moco too but he doesn't a good choice for counter her We won't categorize him as a counter of moco.

=== Moco X Suzy ===
Suzy can increase ff coin when enemies has marked Moco is the good partner for Suzy.

=== Moco X Nero and Ryden ===
Moco can use with skill that can make damage for sure Nero and Ryden it's one of the combo of moco too.

