== Counter of Moco ==
Even though her information,there are no negative side effects. we still have ways to deal with her. There are four ways to counter Moco.

=== Invisible of Morse ===
When Morse enters stealth mode, all marks or location skills are removed, including those of Moco. Whether Moco is shot before or during Morse's use, her marks will have no effect whatsoever, unless Morse's skills have expired.

=== Purify of joseph ===
Joseph's skill can completely remove Moco mark within 5 seconds while Joseph's skill is still active.

=== Sensei Tig ===
Tig can reduce Moco mark duration by 50%. In the OB53 patch, Moco mark duration would be very short, making Tig a more effective counter to Moco.

=== The last method ===
Simply standing still or reducing movement can help Moco disappear faster.

== An unexpected counter ==
Although Joseph's skill can counter Moco, Moco can also counter Joseph. Joseph is immune to debuffs and Mark too players using Joseph are completely unaffected by these debuffs, making him very easy to play. However, Moco is a skill that can pressure Joseph because when Moco activates, Joseph immediately blocks Moco's debuffs. This differs from Morse, where you can choose to block its own debuffs, while Joseph doesn't. Joseph is also one of the most crucial skills in combat; using it too early can disrupt Rusher strategy. Therefore, when Mark appears, it means Joseph has disappeared, allowing the team to continue fighting. Thus, both Joseph and Moco are  countering each other however, we still recommend Joseph as an option to counter Moco, because at least he's better than being marked in the first move of the fight.

==== Mostly the role that use moco it be Bomber or Sniper you need to be careful from them. ====

== Moco recommended mode ==
Her ability can use for yourself or teammates her options are diverse and always useful in combat, but because her information is shared with teammates, her skills are more suited to team mode.

BR Ranked - Battle royale 

Solo mode: ✔️ (Can) 

Duo mode: ✔️ (Recommend) 

Team mode: ✔️ (Recommend)  

CS Ranked - Clash squad ✔️ (Recommend)  

Lone wolf mode - ✔️ (Can)  

Custom mode - ❗️ because the host may not allow its use; it depends on the host.  

Event mode - ✖️ In most, event mode does not have skills available to use.  

== Recommend role ==
Moco is a great partner. She's versatile and can fit into any playstyle, whether Rusher, Support, Bomber, or Sniper. However, if we were to recommend, her skills are best suited for Support or Bomber roles because while information doesn't directly aid combat (unless Maro), it's very useful for decision-making and teamwork.

